    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "15165eb0-288a-49e4-bbd3-bebae043906e",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "57431096-7e21-4246-b98c-54c416d7f950"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-06-03T06:19:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-06-03T06:25:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Being a liquidity provider is akin to being the person to reach out with an offer. This can be pretty risky! The first rule of salary negotiation is “never be the first to give a number”; because if you do, then you’ve instantly set a ceiling on how good the trade can be for you. If you tell them that you’re willing to work for $150k a year, they might have been willing to offer $200k, but now you’ll never know.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Being a liquidity provider is akin to being the person to reach out with an offer. This can be pretty risky! The first rule of salary negotiation is “never be the first to give a number”; because if you do, then you’ve instantly set a ceiling on how good the trade can be for you. If you tell them that you’re willing to work for $150k a year, they might have been willing to offer $200k, but now you’ll never know.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "f48929c4-f2ed-4045-bced-cb1e6d4c8b52",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "57431096-7e21-4246-b98c-54c416d7f950"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-06-03T06:20:00.000Z",
